WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:15.621
Raff thought.

2
00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:17.462
"That's amazing.

3
00:00:18.362 --> 00:00:20.903
Two of the kid heroes are coming to Stone Wall!"

4
00:00:21.724 --> 00:00:26.326
His sister had just finished telling him and Loro exactly what Zann and Perda had said.

5
00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:31.228
As the spy fly buzzed away, Zella looked ready to faint from excitement.

6
00:00:32.812 --> 00:00:33.312
"This is incredible!"

7
00:00:33.673 --> 00:00:34.053
she said.

8
00:00:34.073 --> 00:00:38.296
"Zann and Perda are coming to Stone Wall tomorrow!

9
00:00:39.357 --> 00:00:40.297
Am I dreaming?

10
00:00:41.078 --> 00:00:43.019
I wish Gliss and Darb were coming too.

11
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:44.520
But that's okay.

12
00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.421
Maybe I can meet them another time."

13
00:00:47.382 --> 00:00:48.643
Loro scratched his head.

14
00:00:48.663 --> 00:00:51.765
"I still don't understand why they're coming here.

15
00:00:52.866 --> 00:00:57.069
Maybe you should send another message and remind them that we don't know if that was a relic

16
00:00:57.089 --> 00:00:57.769
that we saw.

17
00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.412
We don't even know if the cave is anything special."

18
00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.360
Raff shrugged.

19
00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:05.661
"You could be right, Loro.

20
00:01:06.161 --> 00:01:11.042
But they know more about relics than we do, and the crown and staff do seem old and

21
00:01:11.082 --> 00:01:14.383
valuable. It's probably a good idea for them to come."

22
00:01:15.424 --> 00:01:17.124
Loro didn't look convinced.

23
00:01:18.164 --> 00:01:20.465
"To me, it seems like a waste of time.

24
00:01:21.545 --> 00:01:25.286
Who knows if any of that stuff actually belonged to King Zanta."

25
00:01:25.306 --> 00:01:28.707
"I have my doubts too," Raff said.

26
00:01:28.727 --> 00:01:33.665
"But we are very close to Zanta's fortress—it's only a couple of zaps away.

27
00:01:34.506 --> 00:01:36.947
We've been there on school field trips a couple of times."

28
00:01:38.068 --> 00:01:40.450
"Really?" Now Loro looked interested.

29
00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:42.171
"That's cool."

30
00:01:43.111 --> 00:01:45.833
Zella didn't seem to be listening to the conversation at all.

31
00:01:45.853 --> 00:01:49.576
"I can't wait to ask Zann and Perda about their adventures.

32
00:01:50.336 --> 00:01:52.658
I mean, I read or watched all their interviews.

33
00:01:53.438 --> 00:01:55.600
But I have so many questions for them."

34
00:01:55.620 --> 00:02:01.544
"They're not coming here to answer their number one fan's questions," Raff said.

35
00:02:02.496 --> 00:02:05.379
He thought about what Zann and Perda had revealed in their message.

36
00:02:05.399 --> 00:02:09.702
"I remember reading about those shape-shifters from Fest.

37
00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:13.225
But I don't understand why they would be here in Magica.

38
00:02:14.326 --> 00:02:16.848
Or why they'd be interested in the Mask of Zanta.

39
00:02:17.609 --> 00:02:19.830
Zella, can I borrow those books again when we get home?"

40
00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:21.792
"Sure," Zella said.

41
00:02:21.812 --> 00:02:24.674
"I'm curious about the Festians too.

42
00:02:25.735 --> 00:02:27.957
Let's forget about sneaking into the cave for now.

43
00:02:28.718 --> 00:02:31.100
We can go home and get the books and read about Fest."

44
00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:34.390
"I doubt you'll learn anything," Loro said.

45
00:02:35.291 --> 00:02:36.031
Raff shrugged.

46
00:02:36.051 --> 00:02:37.492
"We might.

47
00:02:37.872 --> 00:02:39.934
Besides, we need to check on Muncher too.

48
00:02:41.155 --> 00:02:42.716
It's weird how he acted earlier."

49
00:02:43.776 --> 00:02:45.217
They walked back toward the village.

50
00:02:45.878 --> 00:02:48.059
Halfway there, they came across Muncher.

51
00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:51.141
He was in a clearing, nibbling at some flowers.

52
00:02:51.161 --> 00:02:53.243
"Huh, there you are."

53
00:02:54.023 --> 00:02:55.124
Raff patted the donkey.

54
00:02:55.144 --> 00:02:57.065
"Why did you run off?"

55
00:02:58.026 --> 00:03:00.488
"Hee-haw!" was the animal's only reply.

56
00:03:01.364 --> 00:03:04.226
He trotted off toward home, and the three kids followed.

57
00:03:05.466 --> 00:03:10.009
When they reached the edge of the village, Raff and Zella turned in the direction of their house.

58
00:03:10.809 --> 00:03:11.790
But Loro stopped.

59
00:03:13.311 --> 00:03:15.552
"I should go home and check on my new house.

60
00:03:16.513 --> 00:03:18.294
My parents are away for a few days."

61
00:03:18.314 --> 00:03:20.535
"Your parents left already?"

62
00:03:20.955 --> 00:03:22.056
Raff was surprised.

63
00:03:22.076 --> 00:03:23.917
"But you just got here.

64
00:03:24.857 --> 00:03:27.159
Did they have to take care of something back at your old home?"

65
00:03:27.939 --> 00:03:28.820
"Something like that."

66
00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:31.221
Loro waved and took off.

67
00:03:31.241 --> 00:03:33.562
"Good luck with your reading.

68
00:03:33.982 --> 00:03:34.682
See you later."

69
00:03:36.083 --> 00:03:39.744
Soon Raff and Zella were in her room, surrounded by books.

70
00:03:40.785 --> 00:03:43.245
Raff quickly found some information about Fest.

71
00:03:44.106 --> 00:03:46.387
He and Zella read it over several times.

72
00:03:46.407 --> 00:03:50.528
"It says that Fest doesn't have much natural magic," Zella said.

73
00:03:50.548 --> 00:03:54.470
"That's why Festians travel through the vortex more than most people.

74
00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:58.952
They like to visit other worlds so they can use their magic energy in those places."

75
00:03:59.984 --> 00:04:05.726
"Zann's parents say it's a confusing world to visit," Raff said, pointing to a different paragraph in the

76
00:04:05.746 --> 00:04:09.487
book. "The people can change how they look anytime they want.

77
00:04:10.187 --> 00:04:13.308
It's the only kind of magic that's easy for them in their home world."

78
00:04:14.428 --> 00:04:17.949
A few minutes later, Zella tossed the books aside and groaned.

79
00:04:18.709 --> 00:04:20.810
"This isn't really telling us anything useful."

80
00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.051
They wandered back outside.

81
00:04:23.771 --> 00:04:26.472
They saw old Panno sitting on his usual bench.

82
00:04:28.292 --> 00:04:29.833
"Hey." Raff grabbed Zella's arm.

83
00:04:29.853 --> 00:04:32.075
"I just thought of something.

84
00:04:33.035 --> 00:04:34.816
Panno came here from another world.

85
00:04:35.757 --> 00:04:39.760
That means he probably knows more about the vortex than anyone else in Stone Wall.

86
00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.562
Let's ask him if he knows anything about Fest."

87
00:04:42.582 --> 00:04:45.003
"Good idea," Zella said.

88
00:04:46.144 --> 00:04:47.945
The kids hurried over to the old man.

89
00:04:47.965 --> 00:04:51.387
"Hello, young ones," Panno said.

90
00:04:52.288 --> 00:04:53.589
He peered past them.

91
00:04:53.609 --> 00:04:56.151
"Where's your new friend?"

92
00:04:56.171 --> 00:04:57.872
"You mean Loro?"

93
00:04:58.792 --> 00:04:59.493
Zella shrugged.

94
00:04:59.513 --> 00:05:01.234
"He had to go home.

95
00:05:01.855 --> 00:05:03.316
But we have a question for you.

96
00:05:04.277 --> 00:05:07.800
Do you know anything about a world called Fest?

97
00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:10.902
Or why Festians might want to cause trouble here in Magica?"

98
00:05:11.663 --> 00:05:13.565
Old Panno narrowed his eyes.

99
00:05:13.585 --> 00:05:18.449
"I visited that place once when I was young."

100
00:05:19.249 --> 00:05:21.271
Raff and Zella looked at each other and grinned.

101
00:05:21.291 --> 00:05:23.893
"You mean Fest?"

102
00:05:24.334 --> 00:05:24.994
Raff asked.

103
00:05:25.014 --> 00:05:27.016
"You've actually been there?"

104
00:05:27.484 --> 00:05:28.705
Zella said eagerly.

105
00:05:28.725 --> 00:05:30.446
"What's it like?"

106
00:05:31.386 --> 00:05:35.429
"It was strange and disturbing," the old man said.

107
00:05:35.449 --> 00:05:42.693
"The people could look like anyone from a noseless Niffian to the queen of Magica.

108
00:05:43.653 --> 00:05:47.455
But I could never read what was truly in their hearts.

109
00:05:48.696 --> 00:05:55.320
I left there as quickly as I could because it was the only world where my magic failed

110
00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:59.274
me." He stood up slowly, leaning on his cane.

111
00:05:59.294 --> 00:06:07.219
"Although now that I'm so old, my magic fails me sometimes in Magica too."

112
00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.061
"Wait," Zella said.

113
00:06:10.081 --> 00:06:14.544
"Panno, do you know why Festians might come here and steal stuff?

114
00:06:15.084 --> 00:06:18.086
We think that Panno was hobbling away.

115
00:06:18.106 --> 00:06:20.908
"I have to go now."

116
00:06:21.749 --> 00:06:23.050
His voice sounded hoarse.

117
00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:25.251
Zella took a step after him.

118
00:06:25.271 --> 00:06:26.492
"Don't, Zella."

119
00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.123
Raff grabbed her arm to stop her.

120
00:06:30.005 --> 00:06:32.870
Old Panno seemed tired and disturbed by something.
